            </contributor>
            <creation xml:id="creation_545N20365">
               <date notafter="1854" notbefore="1853" xml:id="date_9ba80d12">1853-1854</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_545N20363">
               <p xml:id="idm219">The sonata was not published in Hartmann's life time but parts of it were used in later works such as the G Minor piano sonata (HartW 94) and "Klaverstykker fra ældre og nyere Tid" (Piano Pieces from an Earlier and a more Recent Time) (HartW 120). It was not published until 1944 in a disputed edition by Hartmann's great grandson, the composer Niels Viggo Bentzon.</p>
            </history>
